## 🎯 HERO SECTION

### **Hero Requirements**
- **Value Proposition**: Clear value statement
- **1-2 CTAs**: Primary and secondary call-to-action buttons
- **Illustration/Image**: Supporting visual content
- **No Carousels**: Single, focused hero section

### **Hero Structure**
```tsx
// Hero section structure
<section className="hero-section">
  <div className="container mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <div className="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div className="hero-content">
        <h1 className="font-playfair text-5xl text-forest mb-6">
          Value proposition
        </h1>
        <p className="text-xl text-darkGray mb-8">
          Supporting description
        </p>
        <div className="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <PrimaryCTA text="Get started" />
          <SecondaryCTA text="Learn more" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div className="hero-visual">
        <HeroImage />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
```

## 🃏 KORTTIGRID / CARD GRID

### **Card Design Requirements**
- **Soft Shadows**: Subtle shadow effects
- **Medium-Large Border Radius**: 12px-16px border radius
- **Consistent Spacing**: 8px base unit system
- **Responsive Grid**: Adapts to screen sizes

### **Card Grid Structure**
```tsx
// Card grid structure
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
  <Card className="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-soft p-6">
    <CardContent />
  </Card>
  {/* Additional cards */}
</div>
```

### **Card Styling**
- **Background**: White (#FFFFFF)
- **Border Radius**: 12px (rounded-xl)
- **Shadow**: Soft shadow (shadow-soft)
- **Padding**: 24px (p-6)
- **Border**: Optional 1px solid Light Gray (#E5E5E4)

## 🍞 BREADCRUMBS

### **Breadcrumb Requirements**
- **Depth > 2**: Show breadcrumbs for nested pages
- **Example**: features/security → Home > Features > Security
- **Navigation Aid**: Help users understand page hierarchy

### **Breadcrumb Implementation**
```tsx
// Breadcrumb component
<Breadcrumbs 
  items={[
    { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
    { label: 'Features', href: '/features' },
    { label: 'Security', href: '/features/security' }
  ]} 
/>
```

### **Breadcrumb Styling**
- **Font**: Inter Regular, 14px
- **Color**: Medium Gray (#666666)
- **Separator**: Forward slash (/)
- **Active State**: Forest Green (#2F5D50)
- **Hover Effects**: Subtle color changes

## 📱 RESPONSIVE DESIGN

### **Breakpoint System**
- **Small**: 320px-639px (mobile)
- **Medium**: 640px-1023px (tablet)
- **Large**: 1024px-1439px (desktop)
- **Extra Large**: 1440px+ (large desktop)

### **Mobile-First Approach**
- Design core experiences for mobile first
- Progressive enhancement for larger screens
- Touch-friendly interactions (44×44px minimum)

## 🎨 SPACING SYSTEM

### **8px Base Unit**
- **4px**: 0.25rem (xs spacing)
- **8px**: 0.5rem (sm spacing)
- **16px**: 1rem (base spacing)
- **24px**: 1.5rem (lg spacing)
- **32px**: 2rem (xl spacing)
- **48px**: 3rem (2xl spacing)

### **Component Spacing**
- **Section Padding**: 48px-96px (py-12 to py-24)
- **Component Margins**: 16px-32px (my-4 to my-8)
- **Grid Gaps**: 24px-32px (gap-6 to gap-8)

